<title>USA: Superior Energy agrees to buy Tong Rental.</title>
<headline>Superior Energy agrees to buy Tong Rental.</headline>
<dateline>BELLE CHASSE, La. 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Superior Energy Services Inc said on Wednesday that it had agreed in principle to purchase all the stock of Tong Rental and Supply Inc for a combination of cash and common stock totaling $11 million.</p>
<p>Superior Services Inc provides oilfield services in the Gulf of Mexico.</p>
<p>Tong Rental and Supply, which is privately owned, is a supplier of power swivels, power tongs, and related rental tools.</p>
